<title>USA: Masada Security Holdings IPO withdrawn.</title>
<headline>Masada Security Holdings IPO withdrawn.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Masada Security Holdings Inc's planned initial public offering was withdrawn due to market conditions, according to lead underwriter Robertson Stephens &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Masada, providers of security alarms systems, planned to offer 2.4 million shares in an estimated price range of $11 to $13 under the proposed symbol on the Nasadq National Market.</p>
</text>
